  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Karangura Coffee Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Crops Coffee.Beneficiaries: 600 smallholder farmers of whom 212 are women...The Project will establish 2 micro washing stations, support UTZ certification. The project will also provide working capital for procurement of farm inputs and for paying farmers cash when they deliver their coffee to the Cooperative. In addition, the project will also strengthen the technical and managerial capacity of the applicant..</narrative>
  </description>
